From: Loong <galletzeynep481@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] configs: nokia_xg-040g-md: enable minimal HTTP recovery server

Turns on the TCP stack and the httpd command added by
202-net-add-minimal-httpd-server.patch.

Must sort after 401-add-nokia-xg-040g-md.patch, which is the patch that
creates this defconfig in the first place.

--- a/configs/an7581_nokia_xg-040g-md_defconfig
+++ b/configs/an7581_nokia_xg-040g-md_defconfig
@@ -41,6 +41,8 @@
 CONFIG_CMD_MTD_NAND_WRITE_TEST=y
 CONFIG_CMD_PART=y
 CONFIG_CMD_TFTPSRV=y
+CONFIG_PROT_TCP=y
+CONFIG_CMD_HTTPD=y
 CONFIG_CMD_RARP=y
 CONFIG_CMD_CDP=y
 CONFIG_CMD_SNTP=y
